Usage: This script brings information about a listing when you click it twice on it. It also has a feature that updates a property of a listing by editing this property in the Gui or changing the value of a variable in a text block.
Right -click on any list input. Choose "Details of the Listing" from the menu that appears. The menu will expand and include a listing box full of listing of the listing. You can expand these items as much as you want to see detailed information. When you start clicking twice on something for more information, you want a "divided window". Do this in the upper left corner, just above the program icon. This way you can view all open things on a single screen without having to go back to different windows, which is tedious.
